{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名男子上周三（21日）晚在將軍澳工業區疑因涉及非法燃油利益糾紛，遭3名男子斬傷。</p><p>警方反黑組經調查，先後拘捕3名涉案有三合會背景男子。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:20.111710+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":68,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:24:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:15.898096+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:20.111710+00:00","content_hash":"89323175e38727e4d3062b70a308be9a3311ef2cffef45b501e527450f55dd6a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}